    "zh": "先看「算法与硬件」（EKF/前馈 PID/机械臂/视觉，以及提供可信位置的定位源），再看「平台与仿真」（仿真、单循环 runtime、HAL、OmniSim 桥），最后由「调度与安全」把两者串成任务；utils 是被全部依赖的基础设施。定位源（localization）是视觉之外的第二类感知：它决定导航/巡检/返航能不能开。",
    "en": "Start with Algorithms & Hardware (EKF, feedforward PID, arm, vision, plus the localization sources that supply a trusted position), then Platform & Simulation (simulation, runtime loop, HAL, OmniSim bridge); Dispatch & Safety ties them into a mission. Localization is the second perception path besides vision: it decides whether navigate/inspect/return may proceed."
